+The maintenance service creates `/var/lib/graphato-host/postdeploy` with mode
+0700, matching the root-private run-marker contract. Existing root-owned
+directories have their permissions tightened through a directory descriptor;
+symlinks, regular files and unexpected owners are rejected. This also permits
+postdeploy checks on a freshly bootstrapped host with the usual 0022 umask.
+
 `D` is the resolved server data directory (dedicated host `/var/lib/graphato`),
 `W` the configured repository root (`/workspaces`), `A` the resolved managed
 worktree store (`D/agent-worktrees`), `S` the resolved Demo Services private
